tool-catalog-title = Trusted local tool catalog
tool-catalog-policy = Local metadata only. Relevance is not permission. No discovery, network, credentials or work starts here.
tool-catalog-empty = No reviewed catalog. Use /tool-setup <literal JSON path>.
tool-catalog-path = Import schema-1 local JSON / literal path
tool-catalog-path-hint = Enter preview · Esc cancel · no tools execute
tool-catalog-search-hint = Type literal query · Enter results · Esc back
tool-catalog-browse-hint = ↑↓ tool · Space select · Tab search · d schema · Esc
tool-catalog-review-hint = y trust setup · n cancel · d exact schemas · Esc
tool-catalog-details-hint = ↑↓ / PgUp/Dn exact data · d return · Esc
tool-catalog-waiting = Waiting for the local storage worker; no model request
tool-catalog-choose-path = Choose a bounded literal path without control characters.
tool-catalog-saved = Reviewed catalog saved. Select tools separately; no request sent.
tool-catalog-cleared = Catalog tool selection cleared; closed file tools unchanged.
tool-catalog-disconnected = Connection disconnected. Catalog selection revoked; run /tool-setup again.
tool-catalog-limit = Select at most 16 exact schemas per request.
tool-catalog-unavailable = Lazy exposure unavailable on this adapter. Only custom/local Chat Completions supports this catalog; CLI, SDK and MCP tools are unchanged.
tool-catalog-too-small = Enlarge to 60×18 to review. Esc cancels; nothing is approved.
tool-catalog-effects-read = Read safe project files through the existing bounded executor.
tool-catalog-effects-write = Writes/parent creation still require exact one-shot content review. No shell, checks, network or arbitrary server execution.
tool-catalog-review = Trust { $count } versioned namespaced aliases for the custom/local Chat Completions route. Imported descriptions stay inert; only owned executor instructions reach the model.
tool-catalog-origin = Local source: { $path }
tool-catalog-count = { $found } matching / { $total } stored · { $selected } selected
tool-catalog-tokens = Local schema tokens: { $selected } selected / { $full } full catalog · { $tokenizer }. Not provider usage or billing; closed tools are unchanged.
tool-catalog-query = Search: { $query }
tool-catalog-command = Search explicitly trusted local tool metadata; select exact schemas
tool-catalog-setup-command = Preview a local catalog import and its exact schemas/effects
tool-catalog-clear-command = Clear selected catalog schemas without changing closed tools
tool-catalog-retry = r retries the failed local storage operation; Esc keeps it pending.
